##Master Rat's Battle Helmets
txt.collectible_battle_helmets.dia1=These helmets were made specifically for the Rat Army and they wore them into many battles.	#
txt.collectible_battle_helmets.dia2=In the famous Battle on Golden Pass Bridge, the Rat Army used their helmets to reflect the sun into their enemies' eyes, dazing and blinding them as the Rats charged forward.	#

##Master Ram's Crossbow
txt.collectible_crossbow.dia1=Also known as the Infinite Gate Smasher, this crossbow was made specifically for Master Ram.	#
txt.collectible_crossbow.dia2=It was first commissioned by Master Ram when they were forced to siege an extremely well-defended bandit camp, with five fortified gates.	#
txt.collectible_crossbow.dia3=Unable to breach their defenses, Master Ram came up with the idea and had it made by an extremely skilled crafter.	#
txt.collectible_crossbow.dia4=Once made, Master Ram used this crossbow to destroy each one of the five fortified gates that protected the bandits. 	#

##Master Dolphin's Waterproof Armor
txt.collectible_dolphin_armor.dia1=A set of golden waterproof armor, modeled for Master Dolphin upon their defeat of a legendary sea monster.	#
txt.collectible_dolphin_armor.dia2=Legend says a huge clam monster terrorized coastal villages, stealing and eating their supplies by creating tidal waves with the opening and closing of its shell.	#
txt.collectible_dolphin_armor.dia3=Master Dolphin managed to defeat the monster by performing a whirling swim when it opened it's clam. 	#

##Master Flying Rhino's Armor
txt.collectible_rhino_armor.dia1=Said to have been worn only once in his bloodiest battle against the warriors of the Guangdong Province.	#
txt.collectible_rhino_armor.dia2=The armor of legendary Master Flying Rhino bears the scars of the stealthy lizard assassins' spinning butterfly knives (they were the only warriors to get close enough to make a mark).	#

##Sword of Heroes
txt.collectible_SoH.dia1=A sword made by one of four brothers, who worked as a blacksmith. The other three brothers defended their village from all harm and boasted of their bravery, mocking their brother, until one day three terrible mountain giants appeared and rampaged through the village stealing their supplies. 	#
txt.collectible_SoH.dia2=The three brothers went to fight the giants, but each of them failed and was terribly wounded.	#
txt.collectible_SoH.dia3=Their blacksmith brother then locked himself away for days and set to work making a new weapon that combined each of his brother's strengths and weapons. A broad sword, a dagger, and a halberd.	#
txt.collectible_SoH.dia4=When he emerged he carried a mighty weapon such as the world had never been seen before. The three weapons had been fashioned into a sword, but it could be split into a short sword and dagger, or transform into a twin-bladed halberd.	#
txt.collectible_SoH.dia5=The injured brothers then trained the blacksmith in the use of their weapons and by the time the giants returned, he was ready and waiting for them. Swapping between the weapons' three forms he slew each of the giants.	#
txt.collectible_SoH.dia6=The village celebrated the brothers victory and called him a hero, the bravest and greatest warrior of them all. 	#
txt.collectible_SoH.dia7=The fantastic weapon came to be known as the "Sword of Heroes" and each of the three brothers came to learn how to use it and defend their village. They never again mocked their brother, who went back to being a blacksmith and lived happily ever after.	#

##The Golden Spear
txt.collectible_golden_spear.dia1=It is said that this mystical weapon was forged from the fires of Dragon Mountain.	#
txt.collectible_golden_spear.dia2=Its blade reflects the frozen flame of the Dragon's breath and is thought to be able to seek out evil within the hearts of any warrior.	#
txt.collectible_golden_spear.dia3=Only the purest and bravest may wield this blade, and anyone deemed unworthy will be burned by it.	#

##Battle Rickshaw of Emperor Hawk
txt.collectible_rickshaw.dia1=A war cart once used by Emperor Hawk, he would ride the cart into battle and strike great fear into his enemies. 	#
txt.collectible_rickshaw.dia2=It was said that the war cry of Emperor Hawk was so loud, that the cart amplified the screech and paralyzed his enemies.	#

##The Ring Blades
txt.collectible_ring_blades.dia1=The legendary weapons carried by the Grand Masters Twin Weasels, these formidable blades were known to cut through any armor or stone.	#
txt.collectible_ring_blades.dia2=The awesome fury of their reputation was such that battles were decided before they even began, for a mere glimpse of these curved flames would send enemies fleeing in terror.	#

##Master Gazelle’s Tea Set
txt.collectible_tea_set.dia1=A finely crafted tea set that once helped Master Gazelle settle the fury between the leaders of two clans.	#
txt.collectible_tea_set.dia2=Beginning from childhood, the two leaders were always at odds, arguing over petty small things, but these petty squabbles soon led to a ferocious battle.	#
txt.collectible_tea_set.dia3=Before it could get worse, Master Gazelle stepped in and held a talk between the two leaders, serving them tea.	#
txt.collectible_tea_set.dia4=As the warlords drank the tea and talked, their fury calmed and turned to friendship.	#

##Invisible Trident of Destiny
txt.collectible_trident.dia1=There is little known about this trident other than it is, in fact, invisible.	#
txt.collectible_trident.dia2=It is unknown where it came from, why it is invisible, or how it is part of destiny, but nevertheless a great power emanates from the trident.	#
txt.collectible_trident.dia3=§o"One often meets his destiny on the road he takes to avoid it." - Master Oogway	#

##Spiked Egg
txt.collectible_egg.dia1=A mysterious egg found in an ancient village.	#
txt.collectible_egg.dia2=No one knows its story. No notes were left with the egg.	#
txt.collectible_egg.dia3=Only a feeling of great power that will one day be released, should it ever hatch.	#

##Lady Wind Song's Fan
txt.collectible_fan.dia1=Lady Wind Song from the City of Blissful Fragrance was a famous beauty who hid her modesty behind a fan whilst singing songs of unrequited love.	#
txt.collectible_fan.dia2=By day she was elegant and demure. By night she was the Shadow of the Moon, a mysterious warrior righting wrongs and fighting injustice with her silver fan as her only weapon.	#
txt.collectible_fan.dia3=The fan was made of a mysterious metal and was said to be sharp enough to cut stone.	#
txt.collectible_fan.dia4=Lady Wind Song kept the peace in the City of Blissful Fragrance for sixty years. When she died on the night of the full moon the streets of her city were filled with the scent of Lotus blossom.	#

##Iron Fist of Justice
txt.collectible_iron_fist.dia1=Jin Hu, the blacksmith ox of the village by the River of Flowers lost his right hand trying to defend his family from the marauding bandits of Hajin province. 	#
txt.collectible_iron_fist.dia2=He melted his iron working tools down and forged himself a metal hand which he welded to his arm. 	#
txt.collectible_iron_fist.dia3=When the bandits returned, Jin Hu single handedly defeated the raiders with his Iron Fist of Justice and drove them into the wastelands.	#
txt.collectible_iron_fist.dia4=Jin Hu, his family, and the village by the River of Flowers were never troubled by bandits again.	#

##Golden Shield
txt.collectible_shield.dia1=This golden shield was the only remnant from the legendary Battle of Fire Monkey Pass.	#
txt.collectible_shield.dia2=The Battle itself was mere rumor, there being no survivors to witness the ferocity of the epic fight, no one to remember why it was fought or who may have locked in sky-scorching battle	#
txt.collectible_shield.dia3= All that is known is that the mountains shook to the clang of steel for a full moon before silene resettled upon the land.	#

##Urn of Whispering Warriors
txt.collectible_urn.dia1=The 500 Warriors of Tenshu were called upon to defend an isolated village of peaceful potters from the attack of 10,000 demons of the Scarlet Moon.	#
txt.collectible_urn.dia2=Though outnumbered 20 to 1, the valiant warriors held the dark hordde back for 100 days, fighting shoulder to shoulder in formation and whispering to each other "hold fast, brothers, hold fast" to keep up their courage.	#
txt.collectible_urn.dia3=They fought to their last breath and successfully drove the assassins back. The grateful village worked together to make the most perfect ceramic vase they had ever created, molded from the clay of the battlefield and moistened with their tears.	#
txt.collectible_urn.dia4=It is said that the souls of the noble warriors of Tenshu live on inside the vase, waiting to be called on again in a time of need. If you are very quiet and still you may hear them whispering "hold fast, brothers, hold fast..."	#

##Dagger of Deng Wa
txt.collectible_dagger.dia1=The Dagger of Deng Wa is a legendary sword once held by the great warrior "Deng Wa".	#
txt.collectible_dagger.dia2=It is said that Deng Wa was a warrior who wanted to lead a peaceful life, but when his village came under attack by a warlord looking for conquest, Deng Wa took the warrior's role once more.	#
txt.collectible_dagger.dia3=In a single night, Deng Wa defeated all of the warlord's warriors and then demanded a duel with the warlord, which he defeated too.	#

##Master Dog's Ninja Weapons
txt.collectible_ninja_weapons.dia1=These glinting double-action swords were gifted to the great Master Dog for his role in the rescue of the lovely Lady Lotus Blossom.	#
txt.collectible_ninja_weapons.dia2=It was whispered that her father, a traveling blacksmith skilled beyond measure in his artisan craft, wept into the molten metal in gratitude during the forging of these blades.	#

##Master Ostrich's Egg
txt.collectible_ostrich.dia1=A ceremonial egg gifted to the esteemed Master Ostrich, for help in defeating the crime lords of Jasmine City.	#
txt.collectible_ostrich.dia2=The city had suffered at the hands of the criminals for some time, until Master Ostrich found their hideout and defeated them.	#
txt.collectible_ostrich.dia3=The Mayor had the city's finest metal workers and jewelers create the egg in her honor.	#

##Master Pangolin's Chain Hammer
txt.collectible_pangolin.dia1=A long and indestructible Chain Hammer made from the metal found in a meteorite.	#
txt.collectible_pangolin.dia2=Master Pangolin received the hammer while traveling through a village at the base of a mountain. He stayed the night at the village's Blacksmiths house, needing his weapons repaired.	#
txt.collectible_pangolin.dia3=While drinking tea with the Blacksmith they exchanged stories. The Blacksmith said that Master Pangolin was an honorable warrior and told him to return in 3 days, where he will have created a weapon worthy of his honor.	#
txt.collectible_pangolin.dia4=3 days later and gifted the Indestructible Chain Hammer. When Pangolin asked why, the blacksmith said simply, "I was waiting for the right person".	#

##The Warhammer of Master Chipmunk
txt.collectible_warhammer.dia1=A small War Hammer crafted for Master Chipmunk.	#
txt.collectible_warhammer.dia2=Small in size, it is made of the finest metal, and the acorn hammer head is rumored to be infused with the sap and spirit of a grand tree.	#
txt.collectible_warhammer.dia3=§o"The mightiest foe can fall to the finest warrior, no matter their size." - Master Chipmunk	#

##Sacred Warhammer
txt.collectible_sacred_hammer.dia1=A dangerous hammer that is a weapon of great destruction. One slam into the ground can obliterate buildings, hills, or even mountains.	#
txt.collectible_sacred_hammer.dia2=It was once used to cause abomination by notorious criminals, until they were defeated by the Furious Five.	#
txt.collectible_sacred_hammer.dia3=Master Shifu uncovered that this hammer is a fake, while the real Sacred War Hammer is thought to have been hidden before the criminals received their justice.	#
##The Dragon Scroll
txt.collectible_sacred_dragon_scroll.dia1=Rumored to be the secret to Limitless power, with only the Dragon Warrior being worthy enough to read it and learn its secret.	#
txt.collectible_sacred_dragon_scroll.dia2=The secret was finally revealed by Po when he received the Dragon scroll and became the Dragon Warrior.	#
txt.collectible_sacred_dragon_scroll.dia3=§o "There is no secret ingredient. It's just you." - Po	#

