##Po Dialogues
##po.AREA.generics
##po.AREA.kungfu
txt.po_kungfu.dia1=You want some tips and tricks, huh?	#
txt.po_kungfu.dia2=Well, you came to the right place!	#
txt.po_kungfu.dia3=What do you want to know?	#

##po.AREA.dodge
txt.po_dodge.dia1=Every kung fu master needs to dodge, just use §1Sneak§r 	#
txt.po_dodge.dia2=You'll do a quick dodge in the direction you were facing.	#

##po.AREA.weapons
txt.po_weapons.dia1=A kung fu master makes use of everything at hand!	#
txt.po_weapons.dia2=Look for piles of weapons, like axes, swords, or even woks!	#
txt.po_weapons.dia3=You can pick them up, then §1Interact§r to throw them.	#

##po.AREA.fighting
txt.po_fighting.dia1=A kung fu master fights when they need to.	#
txt.po_fighting.dia2=Just get in there and punch, kick, and HIYAH!	#

##po.AREA.jump
txt.po_jump.dia1=All kung fu masters have super great agility.	#
txt.po_jump.dia2=Tap §1Jump§r§o twice and double jump!	#
txt.po_jump.dia3=You can reach up to 3.5 blocks!	#

##po.palace
txt.po_palace.dia1=Woah! A new student!	#
txt.po_palace.dia2=I'm Po, obviously, you know me... Kung Fu LEGEND!	#
txt.po_palace.dia3=Anyway, I'm your new master, so let me §oshow you the way...§r	#

##po.palace.way
txt.po_palace_way.dia1=Every master has a journey and I will show you mine.	#
txt.po_palace_way.dia2=I'll show you my most famous battles and even the not famous ones. 	#
txt.po_palace_way.dia3=You have to §oearn§r the way, go out and find it!	#
txt.po_palace_way.dia4=Just look for my symbols!	#

##po.palace.symbols_q
txt.po_palace_symbols.dia1=Yeah, I've sent out some scrolls and they have symbols on them.	#
txt.po_palace_symbols.dia2=Each one is a different part of my journey to become a kung fu master.	#
txt.po_palace_symbols.dia3=There's one nearby, just at the Training Hall!	#
txt.po_palace_symbols.dia4=Look out for the scrolls!	#

##po.palace.artifacts_q
txt.po_palace_artifacts.dia1=You are a sharp one!	#
txt.po_palace_artifacts.dia2=I've hidden the chi essence of all the artifacts in the Hall of Heroes and you have to find them!	#
txt.po_palace_artifacts.dia3=Learn about how §ocool§r and §oawesome§r they are!	#
txt.po_palace_artifacts.dia4=There's two of them here somewhere...	#

##po.peace
txt.po_peace.dia1=Welcome to the Valley of Peace!	#
txt.po_peace.dia2=I grew up here. Super cool, y'know. No biggie. Really popular panda...	#
txt.po_peace.dia3=You should check out my dad's restaurant! Great noodles.	#

##po.peace.artifacts_q
txt.po_peace_artifacts.dia1=Where are the artifacts?	#
txt.po_peace_artifacts.dia2=They're here. Somewhere, y'know. At least 5 of them.	#
txt.po_peace_artifacts.dia3=I'm not telling.	#

##po.peace.symbols_q
txt.po_peace_symbols.dia1=You want to know about the symbol scrolls here?	#
txt.po_peace_symbols.dia2=Well, one is my famous fight with the fearsome Tai Lung!	#
txt.po_peace_symbols.dia3=Another was helping out in my Dad's Noodle Restaurant, super important.	#
txt.po_peace_symbols.dia4=And when I fended off Lord Shen's wolves from stealing our stuff!	#

##po.gongmen
txt.po_gongmen.dia1=Welcome to Gongmen City!	#
txt.po_gongmen.dia2=Check out the rebuilt Tower of the Sacred Flame and this super awesome marketplace.	#
txt.po_gongmen.dia3=Also, look out for my symbol scrolls.	#

##po.gongmen.artifacts_q
txt.po_gongmen_artifacts.dia1=Where are the artifacts?	#
txt.po_gongmen_artifacts.dia2=In the alleys, on the rooves! You're going to have to look for the 5 of them.	#
txt.po_gongmen_artifacts.dia3=Because you're not getting zippidity-squat out of me!	#

##po.gongmen.symbols_q
txt.po_gongmen_symbols.dia1=Looking for the symbol scrolls? I got you!	#
txt.po_gongmen_symbols.dia2=One is when I stopped the crazy Lord Shen and his fleet of boats!	#
txt.po_gongmen_symbols.dia3=Then that time me and the Furious Five hid in a dragon suit...	#
txt.po_gongmen_symbols.dia4=And then when we fought Lord Shen's wolves who stole our stuff!	#

##po.panda
txt.po_panda.dia1=Welcome to the Panda Village!	#
txt.po_panda.dia2=This is where my panda dad lives... You should go say hi!	#
txt.po_panda.dia3=They really know how to relax here. Make sure you try the dumplings!	#

##po.panda.artifacts_q
txt.po_panda_artifacts.dia1=Where are the artifacts?	#
txt.po_panda_artifacts.dia2=Under the trees, by the streams, who knows?! You'll need to look for the 5 of them.	#
txt.po_panda_artifacts.dia3=I mean, I know... But I'm not telling.	#

##po.gongmen.symbols_q
txt.po_panda_symbols.dia1=There's some great symbol scrolls here!	#
txt.po_panda_symbols.dia2=One is when I sent Kai the Collector back to the Spirit Realm I summoned a chi dragon!	#
txt.po_panda_symbols.dia3=Then there's my favourite, Cooking Dumplings!	#
txt.po_panda_symbols.dia4=Ooo! Ooo! And there's also Dumpling Parkour! Gotta get all those dumplings!	#

##po.harbor
txt.po_harbor.dia1=Welcome to Juniper City!	#
txt.po_harbor.dia2=Last time, I was here I was on wanted posters!	#
txt.po_harbor.dia3=Ha!	#

##po.harbor.artifacts_q
txt.po_harbor_artifacts.dia1=Where are the artifacts?	#
txt.po_harbor_artifacts.dia2=You'll have to search the streets of Juniper city...	#
txt.po_harbor_artifacts.dia3=Because I'm not telling.	#

####po.harbor.symbols_q
txt.po_harbor_symbols.dia1=Can't find the symbol scrolls, huh? No problem!	#
txt.po_harbor_symbols.dia2=Right at the top at the castle, is when I fought the powerful sorcerer, the Chameleon!	#
txt.po_harbor_symbols.dia3=And another is when I fought off her Komodo Warriors while escaping that same castle.	#


##Character NPCS
##character_tigress
txt.character_tigress.dia1=Train hard, young student. Your body must be as hard as the soul.	#
txt.character_tigress.dia2=I used to punch the iron-wood trees by the palace to train	#
txt.character_tigress.dia3=Now, I feel nothing.	#

##character_mantis
txt.character_mantis.dia1=Number one rule of kung fu: Don't judge a warrior based on his size!	#
txt.character_mantis.dia2=I mean... look at me!	#
txt.character_mantis.dia3=Actually, it could be the third. Was it the fourth?	#

##character_viper
txt.character_viper.dia1=Are you from the Academy?	#
txt.character_viper.dia2=It's important to keep in touch with family.	#
txt.character_viper.dia3=I used to love cooking with my sisters.	#

##character_monkey
txt.character_monkey.dia1=Oh hey.	#
txt.character_monkey.dia2=Have you seen my Almond Cookies?	#
txt.character_monkey.dia3=I think Po must have found them again.	#

##character_crane
txt.character_crane.dia1=Wings of Justice is probably my favorite move.	#
txt.character_crane.dia2=You get justice, you get huge gusts of wind...	#
txt.character_crane.dia3=And it's really flexible.	#

##character_shifu
txt.character_shifu.dia1=Ah, you must be a new student.	#
txt.character_shifu.dia2=Be mindful during your training, and remember to meditate.	#
txt.character_shifu.dia3=Inner Peace... Inner Peace...	#

##character_ping
txt.character_ping.dia1=Are you here to see the Dragon Warrior?!	#
txt.character_ping.dia2=That's my son Po but now he's the Spiritual Leader of the whole valley!	#
txt.character_ping.dia3=I'm so proud.	#
txt.character_ping.dia4=Do you want some noodles?	#

##character_oogway
txt.character_oogway.dia1=A new student, hmm...?	#
txt.character_oogway.dia2=Remember, there are no accidents...	#
txt.character_oogway.dia3=And there was something else... I must have forgotten. Oh well!	#

##character_soothsayer
txt.character_soothsayer.dia1=You must be a student of Po's.	#
txt.character_soothsayer.dia2=I see in your future, a great deal of stress... and pain...	#
txt.character_soothsayer.dia3=From... a Wing Chun training dummy? No that can't be right...	#

##character_master_ox
txt.character_master_ox.dia1=A student of kung fu, huh?	#
txt.character_master_ox.dia2=I remember when I was a student... trained by Master Thundering Rhino.	#
txt.character_master_ox.dia3=He found me after I snuck into the Royal Palace... turned me into the Ox I am today.	#

##character_master_croc
txt.character_master_croc.dia1=A great master can come from any place.	#
txt.character_master_croc.dia2=My past life was... §omischievous§r... with the Wool Stealing Crocodile Bandits...	#
txt.character_master_croc.dia3=But Master Thundering Rhino showed me a better path. And now here I am!	#

