##character_instructor
txt.character_instructor.dia1=The time has come! Summons have arrived from the Jade Palace Temple to continue your training!	#
txt.character_instructor.dia2=Make sure to train before you leave and be prepared!	#
txt.character_instructor.dia3=§oUse the Travel Scroll to travel to the Jade Palace.	#

##character_palace_guard1
txt.character_palace_guard1.dia1=I was once a kung fu student, but I never knew how to dodge.	#
txt.character_palace_guard1.dia2=§oUse §1Sneak§r§o to quickly dodge attacks!	#

##character_palace_guard2
txt.character_palace_guard2.dia1=Have you been inside the Hall of Heroes?	#
txt.character_palace_guard2.dia2=I went in there once to deliver a message... it was awesome!	#

##character_palace_guard3
txt.character_palace_guard3.dia1=Another Kung fu student?	#
txt.character_palace_guard3.dia2=I'm really glad you're here to help protect the valley.	#

##character_palace_guard4
txt.character_palace_guard4.dia1=One time, the Dragon Warrior said I was doing a good job.	#
txt.character_palace_guard4.dia2=It was the best day of my life.	#

##character_palace_guard5
txt.character_palace_guard5.dia1=I wish I could jump like you kung fu students and masters. You can soar!	#
txt.character_palace_guard5.dia2=§oTap §1Jump§r§o twice to double jump!	#

##character_palace_guard6
txt.character_palace_guard6.dia1=Huh?	#
txt.character_palace_guard6.dia2=I wasn't sleeping, I was just resting my eyes.	#

##character_palace_guard7
txt.character_palace_guard7.dia1=It is an honor to serve the Jade Palace.	#

##character_palace_guard8
txt.character_palace_guard8.dia1=I came here from Gongmen City, but it's so far to travel back to see my parents.	#
txt.character_palace_guard8.dia2=§oYou can use the Travel Scroll to quickly travel between areas!	#

##character_student1
txt.character_student1.dia1=Make sure to dodge any enemy attacks!	#
txt.character_student1.dia2=§oUse §1Sneak§r§o to quickly dodge attacks!	#

##character_student2
txt.character_student2.dia1=This morning I woke up at night to start my training! Or was it still morning?	#
txt.character_student2.dia2=Master said I need to rest, so I'm resting now. But tomorrow I'm going to wake up before I've gone to sleep to catch up!	#

##character_student3
txt.character_student3.dia1=Are you leaving for the Jade Palace?	#
txt.character_student3.dia2=I heard there's some really good noodles down in the Valley.	#

##character_student4
txt.character_student4.dia1=Agility is important. Make sure to keep light on your toes.	#
txt.character_student4.dia2=§oTap §1Jump§r§o twice to double jump!	#

##character_student5
txt.character_student5.dia1=Through hard work and dedication, one day I will be a kung fu master too!	#

##character_student6
txt.character_student6.dia1=When I become a master, I'm going to join a team of masters.	#
txt.character_student6.dia2=We'll be called the "Super Seven"! Or six? Depends on how many of us there are...	#

##character_student7
txt.character_student7.dia1=Kung fu isn't just using your fists to punch or feet to kick.	#
txt.character_student7.dia2=Use your environment! Even a wok can be a weapon...	#

##character_student8
txt.character_student8.dia1=Make sure to watch for your enemy's weapons.	#
txt.character_student8.dia2=My last fight I used my opponent's weapon against them! They just left them lying on a weapon rack!	#